WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.626 --> 00:00:02.711
We should just tell
the truth quickly.
They're gonna cut us off.

00:00:02.711 --> 00:00:05.422
There are some really
bad things going on here.

00:00:05.422 --> 00:00:09.009
We cannot accept
a culture of silence.

00:00:09.009 --> 00:00:10.928
We have some breaking news
right now.

00:00:10.928 --> 00:00:13.096
Moments ago,
UBA's national feed

00:00:13.096 --> 00:00:14.890
abruptly cut to a test pattern.

00:00:14.890 --> 00:00:16.516
We have to stay
together on this.

00:00:16.516 --> 00:00:18.101
All the attention
is going to land on me.

00:00:18.101 --> 00:00:19.561
Careful what you wish for,
right?

00:00:19.561 --> 00:00:24.399
♪ Start spreading the news ♪

00:00:24.399 --> 00:00:27.236
♪ I'm leaving today ♪

00:00:29.404 --> 00:00:31.156
♪ I want ♪

00:00:31.156 --> 00:00:33.575
Let me make this simple.
We have to get Alex back.

00:00:33.575 --> 00:00:35.369
She publicly left the show.

00:00:35.369 --> 00:00:38.455
♪ New York, New York ♪

00:00:38.455 --> 00:00:41.500
I don't want to.
I'm not coming back.

00:00:44.670 --> 00:00:48.257
They hurt me. This is about them
doing things behind my back.

00:00:49.549 --> 00:00:51.051
It's all gonna work out.

00:00:51.051 --> 00:00:52.886
Don't tell me
it's gonna work out.

00:00:52.886 --> 00:00:55.055
There is a cost
to success and fame.

00:00:55.055 --> 00:00:57.266
-You're a dead man.
-Said the corpse.

00:00:57.266 --> 00:01:00.185
There will always be a part
of me that wants to be liked.

00:01:00.185 --> 00:01:02.771
I never wanted to be
this person.

00:01:04.273 --> 00:01:05.941
Things are supposed
to get better.

00:01:08.277 --> 00:01:09.653
Everything changed in a minute.

00:01:09.653 --> 00:01:11.071
The whole world changed.

00:01:11.071 --> 00:01:12.531
I thought we were a team.

00:01:12.531 --> 00:01:13.824
Honestly, Bradley,
a friendship with you

00:01:13.824 --> 00:01:15.742
seems like
a bountiful journey.

00:01:15.742 --> 00:01:18.078
♪ If I can ♪

00:01:18.078 --> 00:01:20.372
You talked to Mitch.
Did he tell you that?

00:01:20.372 --> 00:01:22.541
People deserve
to know the truth.

00:01:22.541 --> 00:01:24.334
Nobody likes a gossip.

00:01:28.422 --> 00:01:30.799
There's been
a lot written about
The Morning Show

00:01:30.799 --> 00:01:33.176
and a lust for ratings

00:01:33.176 --> 00:01:36.263
that made even the worst
behavior permissible.

00:01:36.263 --> 00:01:39.182
Do you feel that the important
issues have been addressed?

00:01:39.182 --> 00:01:44.646
♪ It's up to you New York ♪

00:01:44.646 --> 00:01:47.524
♪ New York ♪

00:01:50.027 --> 00:01:53.238
♪ New York ♪

